docs {
  # GET /api/service-types/ — List service types

  Returns paginated service types. Requires `Authorization: Token {{token}}`. Source: `travels/views.py:28 ServiceTypeViewSet` + `ServiceTypeSerializer` (`travels/serializers.py:26`, fields `id,name`).

  ## Status codes

  - `200 OK` — success
  - `401 Unauthorized` — missing/invalid token (see `_auth/get_unauthenticated.bru`)

  ## Response (200)

  ```json
  {
    "count": 2,
    "next": null,
    "previous": null,
    "results": [
      { "id": 1, "name": "One Way" },
      { "id": 2, "name": "Round Trip" }
    ]
  }
  ```

  Envelope `{count, next, previous, results}` per `core/pagination.py:4`.

  ## Error (401)

  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "Invalid token.",
    "data": {}
  }
  ```
}
